# Client environment template (names only, no values).
#
# Only PUBLIC, NON-SECRET build-time values may ever be listed here.
# Vite exposes only variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle,
# so anything placed here is visible to every visitor. Never add a secret.
#
# The client and the API share one origin (ARCHITECTURE_DESIGN.md Section 14.4),
# so no API address is needed and no variables are defined at this stage.
# A variable is added here, in the same change, when a milestone first uses it.
#
# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Real environment files are git-ignored.
